{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve grouped thread-control exceptions.** The preceding tuple handler does not match a `BaseExceptionGroup`, so this broad handler suppresses groups containing `KeyboardInterrupt`, `SystemExit`, or `GeneratorExit`. Partition groups at the factory and hook boundaries, log only non-control leaves, and propagate\u2014or defer during end-hook fanout\u2014the control subgroup. Add mixed and control-only group tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7xe5iv","finding_digest":"62d842dd882803ab936e3cbd47fc6c056f462175e487a085c3890da253486a2b","finding_id":"arf_v1_mlmefxmifab2xe3ohs6up7dmav","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python/plugin.py::_dispatch_plugin::grouped-control-suppression","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python/plugin.py::_dispatch_plugin::grouped-control-suppression","line":707,"observation_digest":"501cd7cb09e9a308e9969b9b1ac30cf16146cb5375e8ca0de0089dceb65684de","observation_id":"aro_v1_kaonpsyj5grqr2mwtonrvqym6f","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python/plugin.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-18T23:28:24Z","review_id":"arr_v1_b36gtcrmmlelm5sz4766aafg6j","reviewed_base_sha":"2313fcbf2ac08a1e46c078ab2ba8f0fa44c1ef0a","reviewed_head_sha":"84159aa222a10087bba29cb0f627875921d057de","reviewer":"codex","start_line":707,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":737},"record_id":"art_v1_atwmavb43drbj7uoyhfw562dzo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-18T23:28:24Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
